        Your ears are suddenly filled with a rushing sound. It grows louder!    There are gasps and moans and cries and bitterness and fear engulfing   you. You are carried away through the caverns by an unseen host,        especially unseen because your lamp has been turned off. You loose most of your possesions as you are carried along. At last you are dumped on  the floor, badly shaken and without a thing in your hands. The noise    subsides.--- That must have been the ]sg}rsrei, or perhaps more         especially the spirits of all the dead Adventurers and dwarfs from      earlier times.                                                                                                                                                                                                          You hear a rushing sound in the air, composed of moans and sighs and    groans and fearful rustlings. There's a feeling of a great terror com-  ing. You are grasped by unseen hands and carried away through the       darkness. (Your lamp is extinguished.) As you are swoshing along, your  belongings are scattered all over the place. In the end you are dumped  rather ungently on the floor, while the scary host surges on. That      must have been the spirits of dead adventurers and others who have      perished in the cave in earlier times!!                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         There is a blinding light (daylight!) in this direction.                A room underneath a grate. The stone shows                              A cobble crawl. The stone shows                                         A debris room. The stone shows                                          An awkward canyon. The stone shows                                      A room with orange coloured walls. The stone sho